sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as 🤖 Agent
    participant S as Shio
    participant H as 👤 Curator

    Note over A,S: Discover
    A->>S: GET /agent/manifest
    S-->>A: capabilities, limits, endpoints
    A->>S: GET /agent/context
    S-->>A: model, sitemap by path, conventions

    Note over A,S: Plan
    A->>S: POST /agent/batch (dryRun)
    S-->>A: change set, nothing written

    Note over A,S: Write
    A->>S: POST /agent/batch (?verify&digest)
    S-->>A: DRAFT rows, findings, digests

    Note over A,S: Verify
    A->>S: GET /agent/verify (since cursor)
    S-->>A: report, a fix per finding

    Note over A,H: Hand over
    A->>H: preview link, open questions
    H->>S: publish
